  '- confidence is 0..1. Below 0.7 the label is ignored, so use a low number when you are unsure rather than guessing.',
  "",
  'Reply with JSON only: [{"i":0,"type":"services","variant":"grid-3","confidence":0.9}]. No prose, no code fence.',
  "",
  "Catalogue (type: what it is for [layout keys]):",
  sectionCatalogue(),
